# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          ← imperative, lowercase, no period, ≤72 chars
#
# <body>
#   WHY this change. The diff already shows what changed.
#   Wrap at 72 characters.
#
# <footer>
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and what to do>
#   Refs: <doc path or issue>
#
# TYPES   feat fix refactor perf docs test build ci chore style revert
# SCOPES  bootstrap foundation http data view admin assets i18n cache log
#         cli coexistence frontend docs adr ci deps
#
# Full rules: .claude/rules/50-git-and-commits.md
